<title>USA: Metzler unit names Ruprecht president.</title>
<headline>Metzler unit names Ruprecht president.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metzler Group Inc said on Monday it promoted James Ruprecht to the newly created position of president of its Metzler &amp; Associates unit.</p>
<p>Ruprecht, 38, previously was a Metzler &amp; Associates vice president, the company said in a news release.</p>
<p>Metzler Group provides consulting services to electric and natural gas utilities and other energy-related businesses.</p>
</text>
